{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "615c121e9b6bdef945716e27851a3518ed864b57fdfc54e99c22a1bb00fcc1fd", "ja": "ひとりじゃないから", "zh": "因为你并非孤身一人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "28224c9940dea73b489d1bbea84f959f00f48027163fe2d4ded18cfa0c040370", "ja": "のり子と紬が劇場に戻ると、翼とひなたが\n待ち構えていた。自分達もデートコースを\n考えたというふたりに、紬はデートは後日の\nお楽しみにして今日は本読みに付き合って\nほしいと頼み、メンバーは稽古を開始する。", "zh": "福田法子和白石紬回到剧场时，伊吹翼和木下日向\n正等在那里。面对说自己也想好了约会路线的两人，白石紬\n拜托她们把约会留到以后再享受，今天先陪自己读剧本，\n于是成员们开始排练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc8e6f6446d3dffec97fdfacec47888f90e473dcf8f4937a04411a03d9f44fb1", "ja": "（のり子と紬が出て行ってから、結構経ったけど……\nお、バイクの音だ。戻って来たのかな）", "zh": "（诺莉子和紬出门后已经过了挺长时间，不过……哦，是摩托车的声音。她们回来了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d8a52bad78125af01523b554fe6b116a9ba50f70097b69e16b229bf2ff65ba9b", "ja": "あ～、やっと戻ってきた～！\nふたりとも、デート長すぎですよ？", "zh": "啊～，终于回来了～！\n你们两个，约会也太久了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f8b08f06dc8249b3480dbe0c2880d659335026f2aa18882fbc5ce7f60d118573", "ja": "で、デート……。\nそういうことになるのでしょうか……？", "zh": "约、约会……。\n原来是这么回事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "61ce4d65784bcf046eef45ba3bd2eabbea34db0a7c6e4b508bdc1ccd0a964f0e", "ja": "翼、そういう言い方されると恥ずかしいから！\nタンデムね！", "zh": "翼，你这么说我会害羞的啦！\n是双人骑行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5e51b6cdc42e83f54caf5ffea292f772c0bde884ca6c553f63b3f4f1314d77d5", "ja": "だって～。わたしとひなたちゃんも、\n紬さんとのデートコース、考えてたのに！", "zh": "因为嘛～我和小日向也在帮紬小姐想和她约会的路线呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7f43f7ed11fae2fd774f55f9f70608fdfcbf8e78fb30f4f581f39d27b1972561", "ja": "最初は、いっしょにショッピングでしょ？\nで、そのあとは抹茶スイーツ食べて～……。", "zh": "一开始，先一起去购物嘛？\n然后之后再去吃抹茶甜点～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "8910478581b7b6677672f330ea0c4f181e00ad9bb06154d80761d93f08a837e9", "ja": "帰りは、あたしの家に寄ってもらおうかと思ってねえ。\n古漬けにしたなすときゅうりが、食べごろなんだわ。", "zh": "回去的时候，我想请你顺道来我家坐坐呢。\n腌了很久的茄子和黄瓜，正好到了最美味的时候哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b2455e539f5ac2a90fea1e2bad573b8960ed2f090e1c45461e3d438058a22e51", "ja": "ねっ、完璧なデートコースじゃないですか？\nひなたちゃんと、ふたりで考えたんだよね～♪", "zh": "你看，这不是完美的约会路线吗？  \n是我和日向两个人一起想的呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "874312470fefc770866fdb6d99b0595c375240b6ae60235e735347f590b2f447", "ja": "翼ちゃんが、あたしのお漬物を食べたら、紬さんも\n絶対ほっこりしてくれる、って言ってくれてねえ。", "zh": "翼跟我说，只要紬小姐吃了我的腌菜，她肯定也会觉得心里暖暖的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "73b091945df4e548dafeab7e1aa448d988f3d70058eb9f8f9eea5c4a741623b1", "ja": "あんまし、珍しいもんでもないけど。\nどうかなぁ……？", "zh": "虽然也不是什么稀奇的东西。\n合你的口味吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "38c420e5a7ddf0af6ac8729a53b12ea8ab7f9de515031ad4556d2af3d17bb242", "ja": "ふふっ。\n……福田さんの、言うとおりでしたね。", "zh": "呵呵。\n……正如福田小姐所说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "8e4a837f7fd26a8218eeff7984cc99566ee53506c188723a7e4de9fa4acf4c10", "ja": "でしょ？　紬がひとりで悩みたくても、\n周りが絶対に放っておいてくれないんだから。", "zh": "对吧？就算紬想一个人烦恼，周围的人也绝对不会放着她不管的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "79de144f0d4d4761ba5e71fe2215dc3dda8c1c86f41ef425878b6bbe0e0dd1bc", "ja": "おふたりとも、お気遣いありがとうございます。\n私なら、もう大丈夫です。", "zh": "两位，谢谢你们的关心。\n我已经没事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fb66b79b62f66bd836f1956751f21b4ff0eb310c3c6b7295d96016c8d68d6205", "ja": "紬。せっかくだし、\nみんなの好意に甘えてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "紬，难得有这个机会，你就接受一下大家的好意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9de7f74e80f7cdee65da16e33ec3a40ce9e927b2c138c1b09c8277cbb0cc5759", "ja": "甘えて……。でしたら、その……\nもしワガママを言って良いのでしたら……。", "zh": "撒娇……既然这样，那我……\n如果可以任性一点的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ed7c594a0147f75aec49f2fb2d2df52c0483af1aead41e3bfed351f716ee0c0", "ja": "今からみなさん、本読みに付き合ってもらえませんか？\nそれで、説明はできると思いますから。", "zh": "从现在开始，大家能陪我一起进行剧本朗读吗？\n这样一来，我应该就能说明了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ab2b84769edf34b13b0756dbb1d93d53744326b2e3d48e3d1553237eb8ade760", "ja": "うん！　わたしは大丈夫！\nひなたちゃんは？", "zh": "嗯！我没问题！\n日向呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "84bbf074f4b359d36150a8015d2356f572e52964c6713c1a93d3fa7f1a8cc91d", "ja": "あたしも、大丈夫だべさ。", "zh": "我也没事哩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "019a27e92c5482c0fc07613c7bb6b92f847d85a9674d9e6f92b4edc4a1351192", "ja": "おふたりの考えてくれたデートコースも、ぜひ。\n今度のお休みの日に、お願いします。", "zh": "两位为我想的约会路线，也请务必安排上。\n下次休息日就拜托了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b9ee4fa6f3c8c2b2f3d4cf630ed0bcf8433d343726708c6743ab0c693597b944", "ja": "ホント！？　やったぁ！\n紬さん、約束ですからね？", "zh": "真的！？太好了！\n紬姐，可说好了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "fe677c2a513fd9d9bd3c11408d32d0981804f24e0c24ca2d3b30ea4d9e6de4e8", "ja": "じゃあ、次のデートを全力で楽しむためにも……\n気合いを入れて、稽古開始だっ！", "zh": "那么，为了尽情享受下次约会……  \n打起精神，开始排练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "da8aa17a71409b2a258cd1d2c5ccb8732b69af30a7e6b7321eba87cc7672af49", "ja": "（紬の空気、ぐっとよくなっていたな……。\nのり子に任せて正解だったみたいだ）", "zh": "（紬的状态明显变得好多了……看来把她交给法子是正确的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c912ce123d4f01bf1077215e61a96fb7a95e1bc31d2825ec4b6ed8dec08526ae", "ja": "（この4人で、どんな『I.V.』を演じるのか……\n自分の目で確かめるのが、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（真期待亲眼看看，这4个人会演绎出怎样的《I.V.》啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
